    "chunk_id": "2024-06-05-2024-06-05-0006",
    "chunk_index": 6,
    "language": "si-ta-en",
    "md5": "8df9714868382571aeb7b9fd06014ebf",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 1541,
    "chunk_text": "While congratulating Prime Minister Modi, I would like to, at this juncture, propose from the Parliament of Sri Lanka that India should be duly made a permanent\n\n215 216\n\n[\u0d9c\u0dbb\u0dd4 \u0dbb\u0dd2\u0dc1\u0dca\u0db0\u0dc2\u0dca\u0da8\u0dcf \u0d9c\u0dd4 \u0dc0\u0dbb\u0dca\u0db0\u0dca\u200d\u0dcf \u0db1\u0dd9\u0dad\u0dcf ]\n\n2024 \u0da2\u0dd4\u0db1\u0dd2 05\n\nSir, Prime Minister Modi has been a remarkable person who commenced his work from humble beginnings. He was from a small family; he did not have a huge family background. He did not have a power base to commence his work, but with his remarkable achievements as Chief Minister of Gujarat and then afterwards, as a three-time Prime Minister of India, he has exhibited his stupendous energy, charisma, hard work and singular determination to make India number one in the world. When most of the countries in the region are going through sluggish economic growth, we see India as a unique country which has extricated itself from the COVID menace or catastrophe. India has been a shining example as to how you get yourself out of desperate situations, despair, economic catastrophe and transform and translate a bad situation into a good one. Sir, I would like to congratulate Prime Minister elected His Excellency Shri Narendra Modi on his remarkable achievement across most states. Of course, there had been states where he has done very well and certain States where the BJP-NDA Alliance is yet to make its imprint.\n\nHowever, I think holding the position of Prime Minister three times is a remarkable achievement and we applaud him on his achievements and success."
  },
  {
