    "chunk_text": "Part VIII of the Bill details the instructions on tariff settings as against the Electricity Reform Act, No. 28 of 2002. As per Section 29 of 2002 Act, the functions on tariff principles and settings are vested with the Regulator and a broader framework is provided whereas, as per this Bill, the Minister can issue a detailed policy. There is a long list and I am not going to read it out. To an extent, I believe, the methodology rests in your hands. But, Hon. Minister, you have been telling me that it is the Regulator\u2019s job to develop the methodology. I hope you would certify that because that independence has to be there.\n\n\u0d9c\u0dd4 \u0d9a\u0d82\u0da0\u0db1 \u0daf\u0dd4\u0dc0\u0dda\u0dc0\u0dca\u0db4\u0d9a\u0dbb \u0db8\u0dc4\u0dc3\u0dad\u0dcf\u0dcf (\u0bae\u0bbe\u0ba3\u0bcd\u0baa\u0bc1\u0bae\u0bbf\u0b95\u0bc1 \u0b95\u0b9e\u0bcd\u0b9a\u0ba9 \u0bb5\u0bbf\u0bae\u0b9c\u0bae\u0b9a\u0b95\u0bb0) (The Hon. Kanchana Wijesekera) It is in Clause 31. \u0d9c\u0dd4 \u0d9a\u0db6\u0dd3\u0dbb\u0dca \u0dc4\u0dc3\u0dc2\u0dd3\u0db8\u0dca \u0db8\u0dc4\u0dc3\u0dad\u0dcf\u0dcf (\u0bae\u0bbe\u0ba3\u0bcd\u0baa\u0bc1\u0bae\u0bbf\u0b95\u0bc1 \u0b95\u0baa\u0bc0\u0bb0\u0bcd \u0bb9\u0bb7\u0bc0\u0bae\u0bcd) (The Hon. Kabir Hashim) Okay.\n\nHon. Minister, I am also concerned about the fact that there are issues relating to certain appointments. We are going to bring in some Amendments and will share those with you. These are progressive Amendments; these Amendments will ensure that Sri Lanka would derive the benefits.\n\nI would like to wind up by telling you, Hon. Minister, why these checks and balances need to be there. Hon. Minister, I have been raising this issue hundreds of times. With regard to the Adani Group's renewable energy project of generating 500MW - we do understand that we need the technology and the financial strength of Adani Group; we need the investment - when the Cabinet\n\n493 494\n\n2024 \u0da2\u0dd6\u0db1\u0dd2 ]6"
