    "chunk_text": "I want to ask the Hon. President as to why we are creating this confusion, particularly at this time when we all know that the Constitution very specifically states in Clause 30(2) that the term of the President is five years. Therefore, this is unnecessary confusion, an unnecessary debate. Why do you have to bring it even to the Cabinet? There was no necessity for it. Obviously, when you do that, because there is no trust, people begin to think that actually there has to be an ulterior motive in doing that. I want to say this to the Hon. President: you have some more months to go and there are things you could do, which would create confidence in the country. You go and make the commitment that the Thirteenth Amendment to the Constitution would be implemented. I am telling you, please implement it. You do not have to wait to do that. Please implement the Thirteenth Amendment to the Constitution in this country.\n\n2069 2070\n\n\u0db4\u0dcf\u0dbb\u0dca \u0dc3\u0dc1\u0db8\u0dca\u0dc0\u0dd2\u0daf\u0dad\u0dd4"
